From 816a982f2812c59433991381fc1623f76bd1858d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: drabikp <drabik.p@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:38:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] DigitalAppWidget: send text sizes in dp so the host's
 density applies

The provider measures at its own current density and sent pixel sizes; a
host on a display with a different density (a foldable's other panel)
rendered the clock ~17% too large or small depending on which panel was the
default display when the update ran. Hand the sizes over in dp.

